liufencn/flarum-user-delete — 后台「删除用户」入口（Flarum 扩展）
=================================================================

Built on Flarum (MIT License, https://flarum.org). This extension
only injects a frontend button into the admin EditUserModal; all
deletion capability (DELETE /api/users/{id}, UserPolicy, canDelete
serialization) already ships with Flarum core.

